    "summary_insights": [
      "Revenue remained stable with a marginal decline of 0.5%, though the sales mix shifted significantly towards renovation and new build projects (+30%).",
      "Gross margin experienced significant compression, falling from 31.5% to 26.0%, driven by a 7.4% increase in cost of sales despite flat revenue.",
      "Net profit fell sharply by 58% from £191,487 to £80,173, primarily due to the eroded gross margin and a higher effective tax rate.",
      "Staff-related costs (excluding directors) rose by 15.7%, indicating increased investment in the workforce despite the downturn in profitability.",
      "The company maintains a healthy cash position of £644,612, although this has decreased from £742,997 in the prior year.",
      "Dividend payments increased to £164,500, which notably exceeded the net profit for the 2024 financial year.",
      "Operating profit saw a material decline of 46%, reflecting increased pressure on core trading efficiency.",
      "The business remains debt-free with no interest-bearing liabilities, providing a solid foundation despite the current margin compression."
    ]
